{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Realistic FPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the tension of realistic battlefields with engaging environmental elements and authentic, modern firearms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/Realistic_FPS_RE.gif?t=1750050090\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3 Independent Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump in and size up your enemy in the battle of wits. Which of the three teams will secure the cargo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/3Independent_Faction_RE.gif?t=1750050090\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Life Ticket Rule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got a ticket? Jump back into the fight anytime. Don't give up, keep at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Heads up! Strategically adapt your play style based on your remaining tickets to manage combat effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/Life_Ticket_Rule_RE.gif?t=1750050090\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cargo Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure the cargo to claim your team's hard-earned loot. Fail, and you'll get nothing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/Cargo_Rush_RE.gif?t=1750050090\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Team-Based Farming System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win and claim loot with your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's in those boxes? The mystery of loot boxes await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622280/extras/Team-Based_Farming_System_RE.gif?t=1750050090\" />